; Den — the move-in prop (den/burrow/nest) referenced by gdd.md -> Level & world design:
; "the move-in prop (den, burrow, nest) is decoration — no tiles, no collision, gone if the
; home relocates." Composed from 3 existing CC0 Quaternius pieces (Ultimate Nature Pack)
; per art.md's own suggestion ("mossy log + rock + bush = a den") — no dedicated den model
; exists in any evaluated pack.
;
; Arrangement is a FIRST-PASS look-pass composition, not yet eyeballed in-engine: log as
; the base anchor, rock nestled against one end, bush behind/beside. Per-piece scale is a
; proposal, not a measurement (unlike the animal wrappers, there is no person-scale target
; to fit against) — flagged for human sign-off same as the House pick.
